  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Continuous presence",
   "texto": [
    "**Kalkıyorum** = me up; **kahvaltı yapıyorum** = breakfast. The **-(I)yor** suffix forms the continuous present. The vocal in parentheses changes according to the last vowel of the root.",
    "The personal termination goes after: **-um/-ım/-im/-üm** for «I». **Ben** can be omitted because the termination already indicates the person.",
    "The time adverbs usually go before the verb: **Sabah erken kalkıyorum** = in the morning I get up early."
   ]
  },
